{"id":"milagro","lemma":"milagro","pos":"noun","rank":1520,"glosses":["miracle","wonder, very unusual event"],"ipa":"/miˈlaɡɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"milagros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-milagro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito un milagro.","en":"I need a miracle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442752","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Crees en los milagros?","en":"Do you believe in miracles?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734831","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Fue un verdadero milagro.","en":"It was truly a miracle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460764","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"true, real"},null]},{"text":"Su éxito fue nada menos que un milagro.","en":"His success was nothing short of a miracle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635303","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"no less"]]},{"text":"Yo creo en los milagros.","en":"I believe in miracles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454269","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}